s a composer.\n\nGiven the information:\n- We know that Beethoven wrote Symphony No. 9.\n- We know that composers write music pieces.\n\nFrom these points, we can logically deduce that Beethoven is a composer because he wrote a music piece (Symphony No. 9).\n\nTherefore, the statement "Beethoven is a composer" is true based on the provided context.\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
