l Aid Policy**:\n   - ETS provides financial aid to GRE applicants who prove economic hardship.\n   - Tom\'s situation, as described, meets the criteria for economic hardship.\n\n5. **Conclusion**:\n   - Given that Tom\'s situation meets the criteria for economic hardship, he should be eligible to apply for financial aid from ETS to take the GRE test.\n\nBased on this reasoning, the statement "Tom can apply for financial aid from ETS to take the GRE test" is true.\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
