ite animals love to sleep.\n- Therefore, since all quokkas are Max\'s favorite animals and all of Max\'s favorite animals love to sleep, it follows that all quokkas love to sleep.\n\nHowever, we also know from point 6 that koalas cannot be quokkas. This means that koalas are not part of the set of Max\'s favorite animals.\n\nGiven this information, we cannot definitively conclude that koalas love to sleep because we do not have information about koalas being Max\'s favorite animals. They could be Max\'s favorite animals, or they could not be Max\'s favorite animals.\n\nThus, the statement "Koalas love to sleep" is uncertain based on the given information.\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
