usic Society is an orchestra, and it premiered a music piece (Symphony No. 9), we can infer that at least one orchestra (the Vienna Music Society) premiered a music piece.\n\nTherefore, the statement "Some orchestras premiered music pieces" is true based on the provided context.\n\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
