ian does not contradict the fact that it is published by New Vessel Press and therefore must be in English.\n\n4. **Conclusion**:\n   - Given that Neapolitan Chronicles is published by New Vessel Press, and all books published by New Vessel Press are in English, the statement "Neapolitan Chronicles is an English book" is true.\n..\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
