 Breaking Bad.\n\n4. **Conclusion:**.\n   - The statement "Breaking Bad is on Monday at 8 pm" is false because the show on TV at 8 pm on those Mondays is the Bachelor, not Breaking Bad. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
