rros 2022 lost to Iga Świątek, and everyone who lost to Iga Świątek is ranked highly by the WTA, it follows that all female tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 are ranked highly by the WTA.\n   - Since all female tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 are ranked highly by the WTA, and Coco Gauff is not a male tennis player at Roland Garros 2022 (from the given information), Coco Gauff must be a female tennis player at Roland Garros 2022.\n   - Since Coco Gauff is a female tennis player at Roland Garros 2022, and all female tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 lost to Iga Świątek, Coco Gauff lost to Iga Świątek.\n   - Since Coco Gauff lost to Iga Świątek, and everyone who lost to Iga Świątek is ranked highly by the WTA, Coco Gauff is ranked highly by the WTA.\n   - Since Coco Gauff is ranked highly by the WTA, and Coco Gauff is a female tennis player at Roland Garros 2022, Coco Gauff is among the most active players in major tennis.\n\n3. **Evaluating the Statement:**.\n   - The statement to evaluate is: "Coco Gauff is not a player who lost to Iga Świątek or one of the most active players in major tennis.".\n   - From the analysis, we know that Coco Gauff lost to Iga Świątek and is among the most active players in major tennis.\n\n4. **Conclusion:**.\n   - The statement is false because Coco Gauff is indeed a player who lost to Iga Świątek and is among the most active players in major tennis. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
