ut the urban population of Beijing compared to other Chinese cities.\n   - The context does not mention any other Chinese cities by name or their population sizes.\n\n4. **Comparison with Other Cities**:\n   - To determine if Beijing is the second largest Chinese city by urban population, we would need additional information about the urban populations of other major Chinese cities.\n   - The context does not provide this information.\n\n5. **Conclusion**:\n   - Without specific data on the urban population of other major Chinese cities, we cannot definitively state whether Beijing is the second largest or not.\n   - The context only confirms Beijing\'s status as the most populous national capital city but does not provide the necessary comparative data.\n\nGiven this analysis, the statement "Beijing is the second largest Chinese city by urban population" is uncertain based on the provided information.\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
