s.\n\nGiven that Michael is taller than everyone else in his class, and Peter is shorter than Michael, it logically follows that Peter is shorter than a man in Michael\'s class (Michael).\n\nTherefore, the statement "Peter is shorter than a man in Michael\'s class" is true.\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
