kittish).\n- The rock is not a rabbit (as all rabbits are cute, but this does not contradict the rock being still).\n- The rock is not a turtle (as the context does not provide any information about the rock being a turtle).\n\nGiven the information provided, we cannot conclude that the rock is a turtle. The rock being still does not provide any information about its classification as a turtle.\n\nThus, the statement "Rock is a turtle" is uncertain based on the given context.\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
